					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">Not serviced</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005a-s " data-id="e0005a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Rate</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">+22 s/day</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">Price</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005f">2,600</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Showing 9 of 94. The rest of the stock file is available on request or in the shop.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i"><a href="#browse" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		See the full catalogue →
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">The four-point inspection</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005n" class="e-ykrhga-e0005n-s e-heading-base">We open the case, and then we write down what we found.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">We open the case, photograph the movement, time it in five positions, pressure-test water resistance, and check every part against the reference. If a part is not original we say which one and why.</p>
					<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0005p-s" data-interaction-id="e0005p" id="92" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Watchmaker’s bench with tools and a movement under inspection"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005q-s " data-id="e0005q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005r e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005r-s " data-id="e0005r" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005u" class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-heading-base">The case comes off</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">Every watch is opened on the bench and the movement photographed before anything else happens. Those photographs go in the file whether they flatter the watch or not.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005y" class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-heading-base">Five positions on the Witschi</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005z">Dial up, dial down, crown down, crown left, crown up. We publish the average daily rate, the beat error and the amplitude, not a rounded number that sounds good.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00062" class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-heading-base">Pressure, not a promise</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">Water resistance is tested on a dry chamber and reported as tested to a depth, or reported as not tested. Vintage gaskets are replaced only where the case design allows it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">04</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00066" class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-heading-base">Every part against the reference</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00067-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00067">Hands, dial, crown, bezel, bracelet and movement are checked against the reference. If a part is not original we say which one and why.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00068 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00068-s " data-id="e00068" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00068">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00069 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00069-s " data-id="e00069" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00069">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">The provenance file</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006d" class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-heading-base">Four documents travel with every watch.</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006e">Every watch ships with a printed file: movement photographs, timing results, service history, and the chain of ownership as far back as we can prove it. Where we cannot prove it we write unknown.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006f e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0006f-s " data-id="e0006f" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006h">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006i" class="e-ykrhga-e0006i-s e-heading-base">Movement photographs</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">Full-plate and detail shots taken with the case back off, before and after any service work.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006l">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006m" class="e-ykrhga-e0006m-s e-heading-base">Timing results</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006n">Witschi printout across five positions: rate, amplitude and beat error, dated and signed.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006p">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006q" class="e-ykrhga-e0006q-s e-heading-base">Service history</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006r">Invoices and worksheets from us and from every prior watchmaker we could trace.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006s-s " data-id="e0006s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006s">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006t">04</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006u" class="e-ykrhga-e0006u-s e-heading-base">Chain of ownership</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006v">Names, dates and territories as far back as we can prove it. Where we cannot prove it we write unknown.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006x-s " data-id="e0006x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006y-s " data-id="e0006y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">The grading scale</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00070" class="e-ykrhga-e00070-s e-heading-base">Four grades, and no room between them.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00071-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00071">The grade is set by the watchmaker at the bench, not by the person writing the listing. It never moves to help a sale.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00072 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00072-s " data-id="e00072" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00072">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00073 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00073-s " data-id="e00073" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00073">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e00074-s" data-interaction-id="e00074" id="94" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Macro photograph of a vintage watch dial and case"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00075 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00075-s " data-id="e00075" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00075">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00076 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00076-s " data-id="e00076" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00076">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00077-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00077">A</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00078" class="e-ykrhga-e00078-s e-heading-base">Unpolished</h3>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00079-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00079">Sharp lugs, original everything — dial, hands, crown, case finish as it left the factory. The bevels still cut light.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007a-s " data-id="e0007a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007a">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0007b-s" data-interaction-id="e0007b" id="93" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-movement.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-movement.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-movement-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-movement-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Open mechanical watch movement photographed during inspection"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007c-s " data-id="e0007c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007d-s " data-id="e0007d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007e">B</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007f" class="e-ykrhga-e0007f-s e-heading-base">Honest wear</h3>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007g">Marks consistent with a life on a wrist. One or two service parts, each named in the file. Case geometry intact.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007h-s " data-id="e0007h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007h">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0007i-s" data-interaction-id="e0007i" id="92" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Watchmaker’s bench with tools and a movement under inspection"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007j-s " data-id="e0007j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007k-s " data-id="e0007k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007l">C</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007m" class="e-ykrhga-e0007m-s e-heading-base">Polished or redialled</h3>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007n">Soft lugs, a refinished dial, or both. Correct and running, priced accordingly, and described without euphemism.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007o-s " data-id="e0007o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007o">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0007p-s" data-interaction-id="e0007p" id="94" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-watch_macro-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Macro photograph of a vintage watch dial and case"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007q-s " data-id="e0007q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007r-s " data-id="e0007r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007s">D</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007t" class="e-ykrhga-e0007t-s e-heading-base">Project piece</h3>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">Sold as seen. Faults are listed, the price reflects them, and no guarantee of any kind attaches to the sale.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007v">A: unpolished, sharp lugs, original everything. B: honest wear, one or two service parts. C: polished or redialled, priced accordingly. D: project piece, sold as seen, no guarantee.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007w-s " data-id="e0007w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007w" id="selling">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007x-s " data-id="e0007x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007y-s " data-id="e0007y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007z-s " data-id="e0007z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007z">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00080-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00080">Selling to us</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00081" class="e-ykrhga-e00081-s e-heading-base">Send photographs, get a cash offer within 48 hours.</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00082-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00082">Insured collection, and payment the day after our watchmaker signs it off. We buy outright between 2,000 and 40,000 — no consignment, no waiting on a buyer, no fee taken off the back end.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00083 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00083-s " data-id="e00083" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00083">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00084 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00084-s " data-id="e00084" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00084">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00085-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00085">01</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00086" class="e-ykrhga-e00086-s e-heading-base">Send photographs</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00087-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00087">Dial, case back, lugs, movement if you have it open. A phone camera is enough.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00088 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00088-s " data-id="e00088" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00088">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00089-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00089">02</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0008a" class="e-ykrhga-e0008a-s e-heading-base">Cash offer in 48 hours</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008b">A firm number against current trade, not a range and not a consignment estimate.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008c-s " data-id="e0008c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008d">03</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0008e" class="e-ykrhga-e0008e-s e-heading-base">Insured collection</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008f">We book the courier, we pay for it, and the watch is covered door to door at the offer value.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008g-s " data-id="e0008g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008h">04</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0008i" class="e-ykrhga-e0008i-s e-heading-base">Paid the next day</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008j">Our watchmaker signs it off, payment lands the day after. If it is not what you described, it goes back at our cost.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008k-s " data-id="e0008k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008l e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0008l-s " data-id="e0008l" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0008l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008m-s " data-id="e0008m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008n">The guarantee</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0008o" class="e-ykrhga-e0008o-s e-heading-base">24 months on authenticity. 14 days for any reason at all.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008p">24-month authenticity guarantee and a 14-day return with no reason required. Open the case yourself and both end immediately.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008q-s " data-id="e0008q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008r-s " data-id="e0008r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008s">Authenticity</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008t">24 months</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008u-s " data-id="e0008u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008v">Return window</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008w">14 days, no reason</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0008x-s " data-id="e0008x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008y">Refund</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0008z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008z">Full, including outbound carriage</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00090 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00090-s " data-id="e00090" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00090">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00091-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00091">What voids it</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00092-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00092">Four things, stated plainly so nobody has to read them out of a paragraph later.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00093 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00093-s " data-id="e00093" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00093">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00094 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00094-s " data-id="e00094" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00094">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00095-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00095">01</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00096-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00096">Opening the case yourself, or having it opened by anyone who is not us.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00097 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00097-s " data-id="e00097" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00097">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00098-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00098">02</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00099-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00099">A service performed elsewhere within the guarantee period without telling us first.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009a-s " data-id="e0009a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009b">03</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009c">Water damage on a watch we reported as not pressure-tested.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009d-s " data-id="e0009d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009d">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009e">04</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009f">Impact damage, magnetism from a device, or parts swapped after delivery.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009g-s " data-id="e0009g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0009h-s " data-id="e0009h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0009h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009i-s " data-id="e0009i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009j">Who signs it off</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0009k" class="e-ykrhga-e0009k-s e-heading-base">One watchmaker, one dealer, one bench.</h2>
					<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0009l-s" data-interaction-id="e0009l" id="92" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-fourth-hand-bench-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Watchmaker’s bench with tools and a movement under inspection"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009m-s " data-id="e0009m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009n e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0009n-s " data-id="e0009n" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0009n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009o-s " data-id="e0009o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009o">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009p" class="e-ykrhga-e0009p-s e-heading-base">Ola Brenner</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009q">Head watchmaker. WOSTEP-certified, fourteen years at an independent restorer in Bienne before joining us in 2019.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009r-s " data-id="e0009r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009r">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009s" class="e-ykrhga-e0009s-s e-heading-base">Marguerite Adeyemi</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009t">Dealer and buyer. Fifteen years in the vintage trade, BADA member, sits on two auction-house condition panels.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009u-s " data-id="e0009u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009u">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009v" class="e-ykrhga-e0009v-s e-heading-base">The bench</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009w">Witschi Chronoscope M1, Elma cleaning line, Greiner pressure chamber, and a parts library going back to 1948.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0009x-s " data-id="e0009x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009y" class="e-ykrhga-e0009y-s e-heading-base">The terms</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0009z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009z">Registered in England, insured to 2m in transit and on premises, and audited annually against our own stock file.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000a0 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e000a0-s " data-id="e000a0" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e000a0" id="browse">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000a1 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e000a1-s " data-id="e000a1" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e000a1">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e000a2-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000a2">94 in stock · 11 added this week</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e000a3" class="e-ykrhga-e000a3-s e-heading-base">Browse the current stock.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e000a4-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000a4">Each listing carries its grade, its timing results and its file. Nothing is hidden behind an enquiry form, and nothing is described as mint.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e000a5-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000a5"><a href="#catalogue" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Browse the catalogue
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000a6 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e000a6-s " data-id="e000a6" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e000a6">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000a7 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e000a7-s " data-id="e000a7" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e000a7">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000a8 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e000a8-s " data-id="e000a8" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e000a8">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e000a9-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000a9">Fourth Hand · 14 Clerkenwell Green, London · Registered in England 00000000</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e000aa-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e000aa">Every watch on this page has been opened.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e000ab elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e000ab" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
